  "localExtensions": {
    "P5-CLOSE": "NEW P5-CLOSE extension applies ONLY to true Demiplane room removal, Maze termination and Seal of Banishment child termination. It explicitly reuses BAN-CLOSE-03, BAN-PLACEMENT-HANDOFF-03 and BAN-CONFLICT-04: end the source first, settle every extant identity exactly once to its fixed origin plane/anchor (secondary occupants project their local offset onto the recorded entry/creation anchor), ignore ONLY transport-prevention at the terminal endpoints. Try full body at anchor, legal squeeze, then nearest legal adjacent placement in the same unobstructed region, minimum displacement/greatest overlap/fixed neutral order (south, west, east, north, then SW, SE, NW, NE on the declared grid). Never pass a wall/occupied space or search farther. If none fits, retain a logical-anchor placementConflict with no fabricated footprint, support, falling, movement or new actions; independently legal actions and clocks continue. Normalize only when obstruction is actually removed or lawful relocation resolves it. Loose items retain pending placement/custody, never disappear. Source has ended even while conflict remains. This exception does not permit voluntary entry, internal escape, new portal crossings or Gloom release and does not broaden the pre-existing BAN interfaces.",
    "P5-EXTRAPLANAR": "NEW P5-EXTRAPLANAR applies only to this spell: affirmatively qualifies an actual creature with an explicit operative extraplanar source flag, or a recorded most recent successful cross-plane body arrival from a different plane into its current plane. A source-created body also qualifies only if that source explicitly proves foreign-planar provenance. This operational travel predicate may include a returning traveler; it is not proof of native origin or a global definition of outsider. Mere summoned/Fiend/Elemental/plane-themed status is insufficient. Unknown qualification is retained, not resolved to native. A publicly known ineligible target is invalid before payment; a lawfully declared target with hidden unproved qualification gets no effect and no diagnostic. A missing authoritative basis in a proposed positive campaign case is a whole dependent-case hold."
  },
